      "description": {
        "fun": "Zygarde guards the balance of the whole ecosystem, watching from deep caves and stepping in only when nature is in grave danger. It's not one creature but many: countless Cells and a few Cores that gather in different amounts to make a dog-like 10% Forme, a serpent-like 50% Forme or a giant Complete Forme. It plays a central role in Pokémon Legends: Z-A.",
        "guide": "Zygarde is a Dragon- and Ground-type Legendary Pokémon from Kalos that watches over the ecosystem and can cancel out the auras of Xerneas and Yveltal. It is made of Zygarde Cells and Cores, which assemble into its 10%, 50% and Complete Formes. Its Complete Forme can Mega Evolve, introduced in Pokémon Legends: Z-A.",
