            "fun": "With all its Cells and five Cores gathered, Zygarde becomes a towering giant with four serpent-like wings, kept for huge threats to the ecosystem. A Zygarde with Power Construct takes this form when worn down in battle, and it's strong enough to overwhelm Xerneas or Yveltal.",
